1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,975
You interest me extremely

2
00:00:02,667 --> 00:00:05,873
Indeed, it seemed unnecessary to
put so nice a bell-pull there.

3
00:00:06,241 --> 00:00:07,904
But how did you gain them?

4
00:00:08,573 --> 00:00:10,817
They were a gang,
and a rough one, too.

5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,470
You must be weary, for
you have had a long day.

6
00:00:15,079 --> 00:00:17,463
He said that you could solve anything.

7
00:00:18,238 --> 00:00:20,056
Simon has not already arrived.

8
00:00:21,136 --> 00:00:22,801
Doran's house that morning.

9
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,495
Now we shall go upstairs

10
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:27,310
Then I must begin

11
00:00:27,778 --> 00:00:29,765
I am a dangerous man to fall foul of!

12
00:00:30,526 --> 00:00:31,775
Oh, if you say so, Mr.

13
00:00:32,673 --> 00:00:36,166
Yes, there were several little
changes carried out about that time.

14
00:00:37,282 --> 00:00:40,710
Holmes, and we shall see which gets
to the bottom of the matter first.

15
00:00:41,012 --> 00:00:42,573
On the contrary, my dear sir

16
00:00:43,462 --> 00:00:46,737
The streets will be crowded, so I
trust that you may be in safety.

17
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,963
Pray continue your most
interesting statement.

18
00:00:50,301 --> 00:00:53,809
The case has, in some respects, been
not entirely devoid of interest.

19
00:00:54,617 --> 00:00:56,156
How did you trace it, then?

20
00:00:56,513 --> 00:00:58,333
No, I never heard of her using it.

21
00:00:59,466 --> 00:01:02,506
I was very weak, but I have
had a good deal to go through.

22
00:01:03,046 --> 00:01:04,558
That will do very nicely.

23
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:06,313
I've got him here

24
00:01:07,023 --> 00:01:08,193
Really, now!

25
00:01:09,255 --> 00:01:12,316
It will very much depend upon the
results of my first inquiries.

26
00:01:13,161 --> 00:01:16,062
I have every reason to believe that
we shall be in time to stop it.

27
00:01:16,947 --> 00:01:20,226
I must go now, Doctor; I have my
dooties, just the same as you.
